  "id": "qra1-l06",
  "world": "qra1",
  "source": "DHM Quran Recitation (QRA1) · lesson 6. From Dr. Hassan's course; every word in his voice, every verse by Sheikh Al-Minshawi.",
  "title": {
    "ar": "مَدُّ الْيَاءِ",
    "en": "Madd Yaa"
  },
  "topic": "Read madd yaa and recite Surat Al-Masad",
  "minutes": 15,
  "learn": [
    {
      "en": "Madd Yaa is the letter yaa with no sign on it, after a kasra. It stretches the kasra: the sound becomes double, “ee”.",
      "title": "Madd Yaa"
    },
    {
      "en": "Now we read the name of the surah.",
      "title": "The surah",
      "ar": "سُورَةُ الْمَسَدِ",
      "aud": "c-1-ar",
      "tr": "soorato almasade"
    },
    {
      "en": "Listen to Sheikh Al-Minshawi recite Surat Al-Masad. Follow with your finger, then recite it yourself.",
      "title": "Surat Al-Masad",
      "ar": "بِسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ تَبَّتْ يَدَآ أَبِى لَهَبٍۢ وَتَبَّ ﴿١﴾ مَآ أَغْنَىٰ عَنْهُ مَالُهُۥ وَمَا كَسَبَ ﴿٢﴾ سَيَصْلَىٰ نَارًۭا ذَاتَ لَهَبٍۢ ﴿٣﴾ وَٱمْرَأَتُهُۥ حَمَّالَةَ ٱلْحَطَبِ ﴿٤﴾ فِى جِيدِهَا حَبْلٌۭ مِّن مَّسَدٍۭ ﴿٥﴾",
      "aud": "c-2-ar"
    },
    {
      "en": "At the end of any gathering, the Prophet ﷺ advised us to say this du'aa: Glory is to You, O Allah, and praise. We bear witness that none has the right to be worshiped except You. We seek Your forgiveness and we turn to You in repentance.",
      "title": "At the end of our lesson",
      "ar": "سُبْحَانَكَ اللَّهُمَّ وَبِحَمْدِكَ، نَشْهَدُ أَنْ لَا إِلَهَ إِلَّا أَنْتَ، نَسْتَغْفِرُكَ وَنَتُوبُ إِلَيْكَ",
      "aud": "c-3-ar",
      "tr": "Subhanaka Allahumma wa bihamdika, nashhadu an la ilaha illa anta, nastaghfiruka wa natubu ilayk"
    }
  ],
